      "content": "but 400mg still isn't doing anything and im just so tired of this headache. i read online that sometimes people take higher doses for migraines or really bad tension. if i take the 800mg once, surely it won't kill me? i really don't want to go to the doctor or anything, i just need to sleep through this.",
